==Grammar==
Warrwa employed a variety of word orders grammatically. [[Attributive adjective]]s and [[possessive adjective]]s preceded the [[noun]]s they modified.<ref name=":0">McGregor, William. (1994). Warrwa. München: Lincom Europa.</ref>

